
About the Project

Laundry Queue Manager is a web-based system designed to manage laundry orders, tokens, and pickup status.

Features

- Manage laundry orders
- Track token numbers
- Check laundry pickup status
- Simple and user-friendly interface

Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Project Files

- "index.html" – Website structure
- "style.css" – Website design
- "script.js" – Website functionality

How to Run

Open the "index.html" file in a web browser, or visit the deployed website:

https://vanshika3907.github.io/laundry-queue-manager/

Project Purpose

The purpose of this project is to make laundry order management easier and more organized.
